[00:00.50]God’s Word shines like a brilliant light,
[00:20.54]Guides our feet through earth’s dark night.
[00:41.80]If we follow it faithfully,
[00:55.16]Surely its truth will set us free.
[01:24.95]He provides us with words inspired,
[01:32.51]Helps us learn what is required.
[01:40.07]Holy writings can motivate,
[01:47.13]Show how to teach and set things straight.
[01:56.71]By these words from our God above,
[02:04.07]We have come to know his love.
[02:11.85]As we read in it ev’ry day,
[02:19.29]God’s Word will keep us on the way.
